{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56348","headline":"恺悌诗（幷序） 澄俗二章（章十句） · 孙宗闵","name":"恺悌诗（幷序） 澄俗二章（章十句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（上缺）物有方。\n口含大宪，手提国纲。\n实邦之翰，爲民之防。\n宵沉狺吠，晨无饮羊。\n千古是仰，昭其耿光。\n（按：此诗题称二章，仅存後章，前章已失去。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙宗闵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}